// The Old Orchard (Orchard_2; bible 4.4, 7.1 step 5, 8.4). The only place in Halden with fallen leaves.
// Isolde's cache: her torn pages, the Stillness measured, and five names (reveal 5.1). The pages speak in her
// voice: plain, questions instead of answers. The Orchard Keeper knew Corvin (8.4 [F 5.4]); the gravestone.

title: Orchard_Isolde_Cache
---
<<if has_flag("isolde.cache")>>
    Pages: Five who could hold a place without me. Go and find out if I was right. #still #line:03a2754
    <<stop>>
<<endif>>
Pages: Journeyman. If you are reading this, you came the long way. Good. Look at the leaves. #line:02048d3
Pages: They fall here. Nowhere else in Halden does anything fall. Why not? #plant:5.1 #line:044529b
Pages: The market has sold the same eleven stalls of fruit for eleven years. I counted. #line:04c413a
Pages: The king is nine. He has been nine since I was your age. #line:0002bf8
Pages: Anchoring stops the fade. It stops everything else too. The Guild knows. Voss knows. #reveal:5.1 #line:055d1b3
Pages: So what do we do instead? I don't know. I know five who might. #line:0c33088
Pages: Sable, who crosses. Runa, Kettil's girl, who walks. Teodor Ashe, who lets go. #line:0bc3c7e
Pages: Idrenne, who never needed any of it. And Pell, if Pell will. #line:0257052
Pages: Don't anchor what I've drawn. Come find why. You're nearly there. #line:02672f0
-> She knew I'd come here. #line:0a722b1
    <<voice surveyor halden>>
-> Then I'll find them. All five. #line:078c291
    <<voice warden halden>>
-> ... #line:009aba8
    <<voice drift halden>>
<<flag isolde.cache 1>>
<<flag halden.orchard.cache_read 1>>
===

title: Orchard_Keeper
---
<<if has_flag("halden.orchard.keeper_met")>>
    Keeper: Still raking. Nobody else remembers they fall. #still #line:0f27c21
    <<stop>>
<<endif>>
Keeper: You're Isolde's. #plant:5.4 #line:07a476b
Keeper: She stood where you're standing. Asked about the leaves. #line:00db7e8
-> You're the only one who rakes them. #line:01edbc7
    Keeper: Someone has to. Nobody else remembers they fall. #line:05d052b
    <<voice surveyor halden>>
-> Where did she go after here? #line:044437c
    Keeper: Down. Same as everyone who asks the right question. #line:06afee0
    <<voice warden halden>>
-> ... #line:0df92f2
    Keeper: That's what she said too. #line:009c19c
    <<voice drift halden>>
Keeper: I planted these trees for an owl who kept the Atlas. He liked the leaves. He liked them falling. #line:088ff43
<<flag halden.orchard.keeper_met 1>>
===

title: Orchard_Gravestone
---
Inscription: Halloway. A compass rose, and an owl's eye in it. #line:0a15d18
Inscription: A second name beneath, worn off by rain. Four letters. The first is an I. #plant:5.4 #line:059ce14
===
